    - target: {fileID: 2858776301035975273, guid: f6fc4fc5ea45e894695bc2d81b5f6385,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Bringing surfaces to life with stunning, color-shifting effects.Whether
        it's shimmering like a soap bubble, shining like\r\na sea shell,  or glimmering
        like an insect wing, this shader adds a unique, eye-catching touch to any
        project. It\u2019s perfect for making your materials stand out and giving
        your visuals that extra layer of polish. Easy to integrate\r\nand fully customizable,
        it\u2019s the perfect tool to elevate your game and captivate players with
        dynamic, mesmerizing visuals. Built entirely in Unity\u2019s Shader Graph,
        it offers complete user freedom to customize to your heart\u2019s content.\r\n\nGameobjects
        using the Anisotrophy shader are on the left, and ones using the Default
        shader are on the right.\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
